2026-05-09 16:00:47,344 - INFO - - **Structure**: A hot dog bun is typically one piece folded, not two separate pieces
2026-05-09 16:00:47,344 - INFO - - **Intent**: It was created and marketed as its own thing, not as a sandwich variation
2026-05-09 16:00:47,344 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:00:47,344 - INFO - So you're both right in different ways. Your friend wins on strict definition, but you're right that "sandwich" doesn't capture how we actually think about or use the word for a hot dog.
2026-05-09 16:00:47,344 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:00:47,344 - INFO - This is genuinely one of those cases where logic and language don't perfectly align—which is why it's such an enduring debate.
