2026-05-09 16:03:15,936 - INFO - - Personality has a *stable core* - traits like introversion or conscientiousness show consistency over time and are partly heritable
2026-05-09 16:03:15,936 - INFO - - But this doesn't mean fixed. People genuinely change through:
2026-05-09 16:03:15,936 - INFO - - Life experiences and major events
