2026-05-09 16:03:53,690 - INFO - Hard work is necessary but not sufficient. You can work incredibly hard and still fail due to:
2026-05-09 16:03:53,690 - INFO - - Circumstances of birth (family wealth, location, health, connections)
2026-05-09 16:03:53,690 - INFO - - Market timing and economic conditions
2026-05-09 16:03:53,690 - INFO - - Random events
2026-05-09 16:03:53,690 - INFO - 
