2026-05-09 16:03:53,690 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:03:53,691 - INFO - **The honest framing:** Hard work is mostly within your control; luck mostly isn't. So it makes sense to emphasize hard work as your personal responsibility while acknowledging that luck plays a real role in outcomes.
