2026-05-09 16:06:14,406 - INFO - Response 2: This is genuinely nuanced—both of you have legitimate points.
2026-05-09 16:06:14,406 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:06:14,406 - INFO - **The case for competitive sports being good:**
2026-05-09 16:06:14,406 - INFO - - Builds resilience, discipline, and goal-setting skills
