2026-05-09 16:07:08,279 - INFO - **Why free will/control seems more defensible:**
2026-05-09 16:07:08,279 - INFO - - We make decisions that clearly affect outcomes (studying changes exam results, practicing improves skills)
2026-05-09 16:07:08,279 - INFO - - Holding people responsible for choices only makes sense if they have some control
