2026-05-09 16:19:48,851 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:19:48,851 - INFO - **Agreement:**
2026-05-09 16:19:48,851 - INFO - - Many animals likely do have experiences that matter morally (sentience seems plausible for at least mammals and birds)
2026-05-09 16:19:48,851 - INFO - - Factory farming does cause substantial suffering
2026-05-09 16:19:48,852 - INFO - - This deserves serious moral concern
2026-05-09 16:19:48,852 - INFO - 
