2026-05-09 16:20:56,816 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:20:56,816 - INFO - **Where I'd agree:**
2026-05-09 16:20:56,816 - INFO - - Transition speed and distributional impacts matter. Coal communities *have* experienced real economic disruption, and planning matters.
2026-05-09 16:20:56,816 - INFO - - "Adequately considering" these impacts is reasonable—not everything should be subordinated to climate urgency.
2026-05-09 16:20:56,816 - INFO - 
