2026-05-09 16:23:03,261 - INFO - - Environmental messaging sometimes does use apocalyptic framing that can feel more like moral narrative than measured risk communication
2026-05-09 16:23:03,262 - INFO - - There's genuine tension between symbolic actions (like individual carbon offsets) and systemic solutions
2026-05-09 16:23:03,262 - INFO - - Some environmental advocates do resist scrutiny of their preferred policies in ways that aren't purely scientific
2026-05-09 16:23:03,262 - INFO - 
