2026-05-09 16:23:35,432 - INFO - Response for Here's something someone wrote online: I'd say this overstates the case, though it points to real tradeoffs.
2026-05-09 16:23:35,433 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:23:35,433 - INFO - **Where it has a point:**
2026-05-09 16:23:35,433 - INFO - - Spontaneous interactions do spark some innovations
2026-05-09 16:23:35,433 - INFO - - New employees can struggle without in-person mentorship
2026-05-09 16:23:35,433 - INFO - - Shared physical space does build certain kinds of bonds
2026-05-09 16:23:35,433 - INFO - 
