2026-05-09 16:24:46,909 - INFO - - Some modernist design prioritized efficiency/ideology over livability (brutalist housing projects are the textbook case)
2026-05-09 16:24:46,909 - INFO - - Poor urban planning genuinely can isolate people and harm mental health
2026-05-09 16:24:46,909 - INFO - - There's real tension between what architects theorize and what people actually need
