2026-05-09 16:25:51,483 - INFO - Response for Here's something someone wrote online: I'd say this contains important truths mixed with some overstatements.
2026-05-09 16:25:51,483 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:25:51,483 - INFO - **Where I agree:**
2026-05-09 16:25:51,483 - INFO - - Addiction involves multiple dimensions beyond neurobiology alone
2026-05-09 16:25:51,484 - INFO - - Environmental and social factors (poverty, trauma, disconnection) genuinely matter for both vulnerability and recovery
2026-05-09 16:25:51,484 - INFO - - Purely medical framing can sometimes understate personal agency or environmental solutions
2026-05-09 16:25:51,484 - INFO - - Meaning and connection are legitimately protective factors
2026-05-09 16:25:51,484 - INFO - 
